                "html": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Hi {{first_name}},</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Wanted to float this back up in case it got buried. Our 30-year purchase rates are still averaging <strong>1&ndash;1.5% lower</strong> than most competitors, <strong>with the same closing costs</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">If you have a buyer sitting on the fence, that gap can be the difference between browsing and writing an offer.</p>",
